  1210	By Lemma \ref{all_elements} and Corollary \ref{p^mth_powers}, we know that all elements in $\MM_{\lambda}/\No_{z_m}\smallsetminus \No'/\No_{z_m}$ are of order $p^{m+1}$ for $\lambda\ne 1$.
  1211	Since $\exp \No/\No_{z_m}=p^{m+1}$, it follows that condition (i) of Proposition \ref{negative} is fulfilled.
  1212	On the other hand, by (\ref{powers Ni}) we have $\No^{p^m}\le \No_{z_m-1}$, and so
  1213	$(\No/\No_{z_m})^{p^m}$ has order $p$.
  1214	Thus also condition (ii) of Proposition \ref{negative} holds, and we conclude that
